  "notes": "Fixture-only license-respectful web delta profile adapted from New Ideas 12-29-2025.docx.pdf. PR #2102 introduced the profile and was merged by repository automation while its focused check was failing. Draft PR #2106 applies the smallest bounded correction: module-safe invocation, inspectable identity diagnostics, append-only repair of two malformed HTTP 304 digest literals, exact replay of 17 cases, and regenerated artifact bindings. The slice performs no network fetch or extraction, claims no full CloudEvents conformance, activates no source, writes no lifecycle state, and creates no evidence, policy, review, promotion, release, deployment, publication, or public-use authority."
